| **Strategic Move** | Bolon takes over Salam to avoid Mayonia | Moreland offers to help Chad rob Lincoln | Moreland overpowers Lincoln |
| **Distraction** | Bolon is distracted by managing Salam | Moreland is distracted by chasing Lincoln | Moreland is distracted by holding Lincoln |
| **Exploitation** | Mayonia exploits Bolon's distraction | Chad exploits Moreland's distraction | Chad exploits Moreland's distraction |
| **Outcome** | Mayonia takes over both countries | Chad robs both | Chad robs both |
| **Powerlessness** | Bolon is too busy to stop Mayonia | Moreland is too exhausted to stop Chad | Moreland is too busy to stop Chad |

